        "eyebrow": "The short version",
        "heading": "What a resin statue is, and where ours come from",
        "body": "<p>These are display pieces cast in resin, finished and painted by hand, and made in limited runs rather than mass production. That is why two examples of the same statue can differ slightly, and why they are heavier than they look. Resin chips rather than flexes, so treat one like a ceramic vase that happens to be shaped like a pirate.</p><p>Everything here is pre-owned and bought outright &mdash; we don't sell on anyone's behalf, so the piece is ours to describe honestly. Each listing shows photographs of the actual statue you will receive, with its condition described as we find it and its original packaging where that is included.</p><p>Got a piece to move on? <a href=\"/pages/sell-to-us\">We buy statues outright</a>, and <a href=\"/pages/about\">this is who you'd be dealing with</a>.</p>",
