        "heading": "Four things worth checking",
        "body": "<p>Much of this market runs on pre-order: you pay now and wait months for a piece you have only seen rendered. Everything on this page already exists, is already in the UK, and is photographed as it stands.</p><p>Buying second-hand raises one fair question &mdash; what has happened to it &mdash; so here is what we would want to know if we were the ones buying.</p>",
