        "heading": "We deliver it, set it up, and store the box",
        "body": "<p>We drive the piece to you and carry it in, rather than handing it to a pallet network. <strong>Estimated personal delivery: 3&ndash;5 business days.</strong> We'll contact you to agree a date and time window. Put your postcode into any listing and the price appears before you commit. In London, collection is free &mdash; usually ready within 24 hours, by arrangement.</p><p>Two optional extras: we'll unbox and assemble the piece where you want it standing for &pound;49, and we'll store the original box &mdash; first month free, then &pound;19.99 a month, invoiced once agreed, nothing charged at checkout.</p><p>If a piece arrives damaged, is missing a listed part, or is not as described, we collect it at our cost and refund you in full. And whenever you want to move a piece on, the buy-back quote is free and puts you under no obligation.</p>",
